  "alignment_method": "Transcription tokens (Chinese characters or ASCII alphanumeric runs) sequentially paired with FunASR raw_timestamp; split on punctuation. Millisecond times are model estimates.",
  "segments": [
    {
      "start_ms": 150,
      "end_ms": 3150,
      "text": "全民已经进入到了一个纯过日子的时代。",
      "token_start": 0,
      "token_end_exclusive": 17
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 3650,
      "end_ms": 6150,
      "text": "这是最近我在网上看到一段很火的话，",
      "token_start": 17,
      "token_end_exclusive": 33
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 6510,
      "end_ms": 9850,
      "text": "大家都不装了不卷朋友圈了不攀比了，",
      "token_start": 33,
      "token_end_exclusive": 49
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 10030,
      "end_ms": 12610,
      "text": "不搞什么排场了也不搞什么仪式感，",
      "token_start": 49,
      "token_end_exclusive": 64
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 12970,
      "end_ms": 15890,
      "text": "不再维系那些所谓的无效社交了。",
      "token_start": 64,
      "token_end_exclusive": 78
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 16430,
      "end_ms": 19250,
      "text": "大家都开始悄悄的找回真实的自己，",
      "token_start": 78,
      "token_end_exclusive": 93
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 19550,
      "end_ms": 21690,
      "text": "回归到柴米油盐的日子了，",
      "token_start": 93,
      "token_end_exclusive": 104
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 22290,
      "end_ms": 24810,
      "text": "不再被那些虚头巴脑的排场所消耗，",
      "token_start": 104,
      "token_end_exclusive": 119
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 25090,
      "end_ms": 28410,
      "text": "也不再被精致的消费主义所裹挟。",
      "token_start": 119,
      "token_end_exclusive": 133
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 28970,
      "end_ms": 32340,
      "text": "很多人啊全民真身心的老老实实过日子，",
      "token_start": 133,
      "token_end_exclusive": 150
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 32600,
      "end_ms": 33420,
      "text": "不苛求拿大，",
      "token_start": 150,
      "token_end_exclusive": 155
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 33420,
      "end_ms": 33820,
      "text": "结果，",
      "token_start": 155,
      "token_end_exclusive": 157
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 34080,
      "end_ms": 35680,
      "text": "不一味向上社交，",
      "token_start": 157,
      "token_end_exclusive": 164
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 36120,
      "end_ms": 37840,
      "text": "不追逐阶层跃迁，",
      "token_start": 164,
      "token_end_exclusive": 171
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 37980,
      "end_ms": 39140,
      "text": "不在乎外界眼光，",
      "token_start": 171,
      "token_end_exclusive": 178
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 39640,
      "end_ms": 41480,
      "text": "悄悄的远离攀比风。",
      "token_start": 178,
      "token_end_exclusive": 186
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 42160,
      "end_ms": 44120,
      "text": "这在十年前啊叫做没出息，",
      "token_start": 186,
      "token_end_exclusive": 197
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 44300,
      "end_ms": 46200,
      "text": "在五年前叫做躺平，",
      "token_start": 197,
      "token_end_exclusive": 205
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 46540,
      "end_ms": 47580,
      "text": "但是放到现在，",
      "token_start": 205,
      "token_end_exclusive": 211
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 47900,
      "end_ms": 49080,
      "text": "这叫清醒。",
      "token_start": 211,
      "token_end_exclusive": 215
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 49720,
      "end_ms": 53140,
      "text": "从过日子啊就是不卷了不装了不演了。",
      "token_start": 215,
      "token_end_exclusive": 231
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 53380,
      "end_ms": 55660,
      "text": "很多人啊以为这是降级，",
      "token_start": 231,
      "token_end_exclusive": 241
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 56080,
      "end_ms": 60610,
      "text": "其实啊这是升级认知升级以前的标准啊，",
      "token_start": 241,
      "token_end_exclusive": 258
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 60610,
      "end_ms": 61570,
      "text": "都是别人定的，",
      "token_start": 258,
      "token_end_exclusive": 264
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 61830,
      "end_ms": 64034,
      "text": "有车有房有面子。",
      "token_start": 264,
      "token_end_exclusive": 271
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 64400,
      "end_ms": 67775,
      "text": "但是啊现在的标准都是咱自己定的，",
      "token_start": 271,
      "token_end_exclusive": 286
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 68030,
      "end_ms": 68590,
      "text": "没三高，",
      "token_start": 286,
      "token_end_exclusive": 289
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 68850,
      "end_ms": 69655,
      "text": "没脂肪肝，",
      "token_start": 289,
      "token_end_exclusive": 293
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 69970,
      "end_ms": 70835,
      "text": "没心脏病，",
      "token_start": 293,
      "token_end_exclusive": 297
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 71190,
      "end_ms": 71930,
      "text": "好好吃饭，",
      "token_start": 297,
      "token_end_exclusive": 301
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 72170,
      "end_ms": 72990,
      "text": "好好睡觉，",
      "token_start": 301,
      "token_end_exclusive": 305
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 73230,
      "end_ms": 74225,
      "text": "精简社交，",
      "token_start": 305,
      "token_end_exclusive": 309
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 74550,
      "end_ms": 75515,
      "text": "他是存钱，",
      "token_start": 309,
      "token_end_exclusive": 313
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 75990,
      "end_ms": 77935,
      "text": "这才是真正的爱自己。",
      "token_start": 313,
      "token_end_exclusive": 322
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 78630,
      "end_ms": 80090,
      "text": "你看过了半辈子，",
      "token_start": 322,
      "token_end_exclusive": 329
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 80170,
      "end_ms": 81145,
      "text": "拼了半辈子，",
      "token_start": 329,
      "token_end_exclusive": 334
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 81460,
      "end_ms": 82775,
      "text": "也演了半辈子，",
      "token_start": 334,
      "token_end_exclusive": 340
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 83130,
      "end_ms": 84335,
      "text": "人生的下半场，",
      "token_start": 340,
      "token_end_exclusive": 346
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 84660,
      "end_ms": 87275,
      "text": "该为自己好好活了。",
      "token_start": 346,
      "token_end_exclusive": 354
    }
  ],
